    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-13-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第13题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-13",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24全国事考）甲，乙施工队共同修一条全长20千米的路。合作施工25天后乙队被调走，剩下部分甲队又用了25天正好完成。已知乙队的效率是甲队的2倍，问甲、乙两队合作每天可以修多少米路？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "400"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "600"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "800"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1200"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          62
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          56
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-13-p062.webp",
            "alt": "工程问题 · 实战精刷13 · 讲义第56页",
            "pdfPage": 62
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-13-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-13",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设甲每天修x米，乙就是2x米。合作25天做75x米，甲又单独25天做25x米，总量100x＝20000米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "得到甲每天200米，乙每天400米，合作每天600米，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "公里先统一成米，再把各阶段工作量相加。"
        }
      ],
